[00:06.59]Ticket please.
[00:06.59]请出示机票。
[00:07.71]Do you have a seat preference?
[00:07.71]您对座位有偏好吗？
[00:10.10]Yes, I want a window seat definitely in the smoking section.
[00:10.10]有，我想要靠窗的座位，而且一定要在吸烟区。
[00:15.15]Sure, please put your baggage on scale.
[00:15.15]好的，请把您的行李放到秤上。
[00:18.42]What's the weight limit?
[00:18.42]重量限制是多少？
[00:20.75]20 kilograms.
[00:20.75]20公斤。
[00:22.10]Yours is not overweight.
[00:22.10]您的行李没有超重。
[00:23.30]Here's your boarding pass and baggage tag.
[00:23.30]这是您的登机牌和行李标签。
[00:25.46]Please go to the satellite hall to wait for boarding.
[00:25.46]请前往卫星厅等候登机。
[00:28.91]Thank you.
[00:28.91]谢谢。
